{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-anima/1470534-anima-history-of-terra-surge","id":1470534,"title":"[Anima] History of Terra Surge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Anima"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-15T10:44:31-08:00","id":1470534,"title":"[Anima] History of Terra Surge","content":"Reading <b>TC Anima</b>, I found a need to have easy reference on at what time particular thing show up in Terra Surge, to understand MMO as RPG setting better. So here is simple list - hopes it serves you good. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> If you want to point particular game event - or expand existing - write below, we will add to list. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (Quote from corebook preview - comments added by me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> <b>Terra Surge Releases </b><br /> Unlike the MMOs of previous generations, <b><i>Terra Surge</i></b> doesn\u2019t need a yearly<br /> update to keep the world fresh, interesting, or engaging. Thus, the developers at<br /> Expanse Interactive take their time crafting larger expansions which release<br /> whenever they\u2019re ready.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Terra Surge</i></b> (2075) is the base game, and it introduced players across the globe to<br /> the world of Synestia and its peoples.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Underbarren</i></b> (2078) gave players access to Synestia\u2019s literal dark side,<br /> implementing several new dungeons.<br /> <br /> <b>Comment:</b> <i><b>Quell</b></i> changed here from NPC to PC people, after players become rules violators, just to play insect race, from base game release. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b><i>Azure Winds</i></b> (2081) expanded sea travel and introduced many new islands to trade with or conquer. It also introduced the Jahat, the latest antagonist faction.<br /> <br /> <b>Comment:</b> <b><i>Humans</i></b>, finally, become interesting to play - they become naval superpower empire on the island of the sea. <br /> <br /> <b><i>Terra Surge: Artemis Edition </i></b>(2081) was released at the same time as the third<br /> expansion and is solely for Lunar players.<br /> <br /> Now, in 2084. is coming fourth expansion...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-16-2021, 01:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}